diad iglisia na dios a walad corinto diad amin da ray tinawag na dios a magmaliw a masanton totoo to diad panamegley na pikakasakey ed cristo jesus ontan met a diad s aray am in a totood inerman a pasen saray ontatawag ed ngaran na katawan dan jesucristo a katawan tayo met
