balet diad agew ya insiput nen lot ed sodoma inmoray apoy tan asupri tan inaatey iray amin a totood man
say panariay dios aliling toy bokel na mustasa a sankamelagan a bokel diad tapew na dalin
ta onyay ingganggan na katawan ed sikami impasen ta kan singa silew da ray hintil pian niyakar moy kilalaban ed intiron mundo
tan diad pikakasakey yod sikato naitdan kayoy nagnap a bilay walad silong to ray amin a pakayari tan pakaoley
