asabian iray balbaleg a takot tan inkuandad sakey tan sakey siopa kasi yan too a pati say dagem tan saray daluyon et ontotoluk irad sikato
nen pinmawil ira asabian day amayamay a totoo sinmingger so sakey a too nantalimukor ed arap nen jesus
andi ebat to ta no baguten yo ray dika ompan napibagut yo ray trigo
biektabiek so pakagogoloan m i balet ag kami natalo no maminsan manduaruwa kami balet ag kami nanaekalay ilalo
