inkuandan tampol katawan itdan mo kami lawas sirin itan a tinapay
nen nadngelan nen jesus a mansasakit si laza ro nanayam nin duay agew dimad kawalaan to
wala ray labalabay yo balet et ag yo ra nagamuran kanyan mamatey ki la wala ray pampilpilalekan yon nagamuran balet et ag yo ra naala kanyan mikolkol tan milaban ki la ag yo nagagamuran iray labay y o ta ag yo ra kekerewen ed dios
inmebat si pedro ag ko nayarian a gawaen itan katawan ag ko nin balut angan na antokaman a marotak o ag nepeg a kanen onung ed ganggan
no ipasen na siopaman a sikatoy rilihioso balet et ag to napatonday sangi tod panagsalitay kaogsan titilaan to labat so sikaton d ili tan andikakanaay rilihion to
