sikato yay makasengeg no akin et wala rad arap na trono na dios tan agewlabin manlilingkur irad sikato diad timplo to samay akayorung ed trono so mangasikasod sikara diad panamegley na kiwawala to
sayan too inkuanda aayaten ton mangigalang ed dios iray totoo diad panangigalang a sumlang ed ganggan
ag kasi say dios et dios met na saray hintil aliwan saray judio labat on sikatoy dios na amin
inkuanton onaan ag mo labay tan ag ka apaliket na saray bagat tan saray saklang o saray bagat a popool an tan saray bagat a para kasalanan inkuanto ya anggaman a nibagat ira onung ed ganggan
anggapoy niamut ed dios diad pakanengneng to lokas tan malinew ya amin iray pinalsa tan sikato so pangebatan tayod kabibilay tayo
ag mo aabuloyan a lemlemewen kay siopaman lapud kinaogaw mo ingen sika komuy oliran da ray mananisia diad panagsalitam kagagawam panangarom pananisiam tan malinis a panagbilay mo
kanyan lapud kinen jesus walay pambabalingaay totoo
maistro tinepet da kapigan nagawa ya tan antoy pakapatnagan ya asingger lan nagawa
balet lapud baleg a panangaroy dios pinili to ak la kasakbayan na inkianak ko tan tinawag to ak a magmaliw a kumikimey to
ibabangat yo ni no say altar so pansambaay sakey a too ag nakaukolan a sumpalen to balet no say bagat ed altar so pansambaan to nakaukolan a sumpalen to
sankaabebaan so kipapasen ko ed amin da ray totooy dios anggaman ontan inter na dios ed si ak yan ki mey a mangipulong ed saray hintil na maung a balitan nipaakar ed ag nabilang a kayamanan nen cristo
balet say salitay katawan anggan kapigan mansiansia sikato yay maung a balitan nipulong ed sikayo
inkuantod sikara nanenengneng yo ra tan a paalagey ibagak ed sikayo anggapoy anggan sakey a baton natilak ed pasen to ta nageba ran amin
kanyan siopa ka man a too a manintinsiad arum anggapoy nibaraan mo ta diad panintinsiam ed arum a too sintinsiaan moy laman mon dili lapud sikan manintinsia et gagawaen mo met so gagawaen da
kalabas na pigaran agew inlako to may yogtan so a pag to insan linmad arawin pasen a diman to dinarak so kuarta to diad aliwaliwan panagbilay
tinepet nen jesus ed sikara antoy pisasangsangan yod sikara
sikayo balet antoy kuanyo siopa ak tinepet nen jesus
balet ag nasabsabaan so panangasiy dios tan ontan lay kaba leg na panangaro tod sikatayo
ontan met ag ontotoluk natan iray judio ed dios pian diad impakaawat yoy panangasi to makagamur met iray panangasi
