ta nanlapu lad impamalsay dios ed mundo say ag nanengneng a kipapasen to a salanti say andianggaan a pakayari tan inkadios to et nanengneng a malinew la tan n atalusan na saray totoo diad panamegley da ray pinalsa kanyan anggapo lay nibaraay totoo
ag lan balut narengel ed sika iray togtog na arpa plauta tan trumpita ag lan balut nanengneng ed sika iray marunong a gumagaway antokaman tan ag lan balut narengel ed sika ray tanul na gilingan
