naandipat so tawen a singa lolokuten a babasaen a nilokut tan nakal iray palandey tan saray isla ed paspasen da
balet siopamay toon mangoonur na salitay dios talagan ayadyariy panangaro tod dios dia tayo naamtaan a wala tayo ed dios siopamay toon mangibagan mansiasiansiad dios nepeg a mambilay a singa impanbilay nen jesucristo
