ag yo ra aaligen amta la na ama yo iray nakakaukolan yo kasakbayan yo ran kerewen
inaro nen jesus ira yan sanaagin marta maria tan lazaro
wala ray pigaran pariseo tan pigaran to too nen herodes ya imbaki da ran mangerel ed kinen jesus diad panamegley na pantepet da
